<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.3 Model Scaling Behavior ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ MANZANO: A Simple and Scalable Unified Multimodal Model with a Hybrid Vision Tokenizer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scaling Image Decoder.</span></a></li>
